    arabicTitle: "زِيَارَةُ ٱلأَئِمَّةِ ٱلسَّجَّادِ وَٱلبَاقِرِ وَٱلصَّادِقِ (ع)",
    subtitle: "Tuesday — the day of Imams Zayn al-Abidin, al-Baqir and al-Sadiq (a)",
    type: "ziyarat",
    days: [2],
    timeOfDay: "any",
